      "content": "The anticipation of judgment is agonizing, but it is a manufactured fear, not a guaranteed reality. You *can* exert control, not over the past losses, but over the narrative of your future. Instead of bracing for pity, consider how you can choose to define this next chapter—maybe the control comes from deciding how you will move forward, even if it's just taking one small step. Please reach out to a crisis line; they are trained to help you navigate these overwhelming feelings of inevitability.",
